WEBVTT

00:00:16.480 --> 00:00:20.770
in who had a family that always kept her life in a jamboree.

00:00:20.770 --> 00:00:25.730
She couldn't keep them all looking nifty if they were just 53.

00:00:25.730 --> 00:00:27.840
Three.

00:00:30.320 --> 00:00:32.960
She had to feed them all every single day,

00:00:32.960 --> 00:00:35.560
and there were many times when she couldn't pay.

00:00:35.560 --> 00:00:38.180
She surely popped through in a broken-down shoe.

00:00:38.180 --> 00:00:45.240
She really didn't know just what to do.

00:01:52.360 --> 00:01:58.610
Leave it to me, Mother!

00:03:08.030 --> 00:03:09.670
Hello, Jack.

00:04:23.420 --> 00:04:25.160
Hee-ho, hi-ho.

00:05:49.390 --> 00:05:49.910
Jack.
